{"id": "124386", "name": "ערכים עצמיים ולכסינות - טענות כלליות - 08", "qtype": "truefalse", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 1, "options": {}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div>\n<p>תהיינה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A,B\\in M_{n\\times n}(\\mathbb{F})\\)</span> מטריצות. אזי:</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\">\n<p>אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> דומה ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span>, אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^k\\)</span> דומה ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B^k\\)</span> לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(k\\)</span> טבעי.</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"native-answer\">[[input:ans]]</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> נכתוב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B=P^{-1}AP\\)</span> ונעלה בחזקה; המטריצות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P^{-1}\\)</span> שבאמצע מצטמצמות.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — העלאה בחזקה</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> דומה ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span>, ולכן קיימת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P\\)</span> הפיכה כך ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B=P^{-1}AP\\)</span>. אז<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ B^k=(P^{-1}AP)(P^{-1}AP)\\cdots(P^{-1}AP)=P^{-1}A\\,(PP^{-1})\\,A\\cdots A\\,P=P^{-1}A^kP. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — מסקנה</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B^k=P^{-1}A^kP\\)</span> עם אותה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P\\)</span> הפיכה, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^k\\)</span> דומה ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B^k\\)</span>.<p style=\"text-align:center\"><b>הטענה נכונה.</b></p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "radio", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": false, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "native": {"shuffle": false, "numbering": "none", "instruction": "one", "lang": "he"}}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "native": true, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": []}], "qvnames": [], "nvariants": 1}